    {
      "number": 12,
      "id": "PR_kwDOOSVefs72R8AM",
      "title": "Formatting fixes",
      "url": "https://github.com/CBonnell/draft-housley-asn1-layman-guide/pull/12",
      "state": "MERGED",
      "author": "danvangeest",
      "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Claude and DVG wetware-assisted formatting fixes to more closely\r\nmatch the original PKCS technical note (and just look better in general):\r\n\r\n- Fix a code-fence issue in the SET-sort pseudocode block that was causing spurious \"no link definition\" warnings from kramdown-rfc\r\n- Add inline code (backtick) formatting for octet/hex values, ASN.1 type keywords, and field names throughout the document, including table cells\r\n- Fix two content bugs found along the way: a \"commonUnitName\" typo (should be \"commonName\") and a duplicated \"GeneralizedTimeTime\" typo\r\n- Restructure several type descriptions (SEQUENCE, SET, SEQUENCE OF, SET OF, and the BER/DER octet labels) as proper kramdown definition lists instead of plain text, and clean up redundant blockquote markers\r\n- Rewrite the ASN.1 notation meta-syntax legend table: clarify the BIT row, add a row distinguishing types (Type1) from variables (n1), and simplify the bracket/brace/pipe/ellipsis/equals rows from bold styling to plain backticks\r\n- Convert \"BER encoding.\"/\"DER encoding.\" leads into proper subsection headings\r\n- Convert all \"ASN.1 notation:\" displays into numbered, captioned Figures, quoting meta-variables in the surrounding explanatory text with backtick-quoted single quotes (e.g. `'identifier1'`), per the notation legend\r\n- Fix a table that overflowed past the ToC in HTML (and blew past the text-output column width) by moving long GitHub source links into proper bibliography references instead of embedding raw URLs",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-25T09:25:08Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-17T13:13:42Z",
      "baseRepository": "CBonnell/draft-housley-asn1-layman-guide",
      "baseRefName": "main",
      "baseRefOid": "244d980954704ce7cf3eb3e51c6bcf0110613d52",
      "headRepository": "danvangeest/draft-housley-asn1-layman-guide",
      "headRefName": "dvg/formatting",
      "headRefOid": "4baf22e391f2e7e61ad5c873ab14ca228414a75d",
      "closedAt": "2026-08-17T13:13:42Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-08-17T13:13:42Z",
      "mergedBy": "CBonnell",
      "mergeCommit": {
        "oid": "3612aa3d19d93e2178c6c63df6059c8b88546037"
      },
      "comments": [],
      "reviews": [
