          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 32,
              "body": "We do not talk about parameterized types. Should we add them?\r\n\r\nThe point is that we talk about features that are actually used in the RFCs.  Maybe we should not try to say what er are not covering.",
              "createdAt": "2026-07-31T14:49:15Z",
