          "createdAt": "2026-07-31T17:58:03Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T17:58:03Z",
          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 32,
              "body": "The tools that I use do not support it either, but it is helpful when there is a list of things that are supported, and others should throw a decode error.\r\n\r\nI think pycrate supports them fully. See https://github.com/P1sec/pycrate.",
              "createdAt": "2026-07-31T17:58:03Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-07-31T17:58:03Z"
            }
